 500's equal-weight and market cap-weight versions was the widest in October for any month since April 2009, as @johnauthers notes in his latest column. https://t.co/aAgQ9xX1xq https://t.co/36bhauJ8MG", "url": "https://x.com/lisaabramowicz1/status/2117263383389159769"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:31:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117263254439256145"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 29, "start": 23, "tag": "India"}, {"end": 55, "start": 49, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "China has gotten a lot of bargaining power out of its near-monopoly over rare earths. Now it’s looking to repeat the trick in a more mundane industry – and perhaps squeeze a key Asian rival.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 116, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-02/china-s-5-000-ton-digging-machines-are-a-trade-war-risk-to-india", "images": [{"height": 806, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117084504183455744/X9lh6lqf?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117084504183455744/X9lh6lqf?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 93, "status": 200, "title": "China’s 5,000-Ton Digging Machines Are a Trade War Risk to India", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-02/china-s-5-000-ton-digging-machines-are-a-trade-war-risk-to-india", "url": "https://t.co/Upx6wqTql5"}]}, "id": "2117263254439256145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1369, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "\"There are reasons for #India’s leaders to think #China's language points in its direction.\"\nhttps://t.co/Upx6wqTql5", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2117263254439256145"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:30:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117263175234277818"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ck_gen/status/…",