despite an agreement to purchase billions of dollars in imports, underscoring long-running uncertainties about ‌the deal.\"\nhttps://t.co/KjgefhgftY", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2117261156209287624"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117260304522395653"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Satellite imagery and capacity analysis reveal that Beijing is expanding its uninspected Emeishan centrifuge facility—a move strongly suggesting an end to China's nearly four-decade pause on producing weapon-grade highly enriched uranium to fuel its rapidly growing nuclear arsenal.", "display_url": "thebulletin.org/2026/11/china-…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://thebulletin.org/2026/11/china-has-likely-resumed-making-weapon-grade-uranium-at-emeishan/?utm_source=SocialShare&utm_medium=Twitter&utm_campaign=Twitter&utm_term", "images": [{"height": 585, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117247366218530816/h_5N9jEu?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117247366218530816/h_5N9jEu?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 65, "status": 200, "title": "China has likely resumed making weapon-grade uranium at Emeishan", "unwound_url": "https://thebulletin.org/2026/11/china-has-likely-resumed-making-weapon-grade-uranium-at-emeishan/?utm_source=SocialShare&utm_medium=Twitter&utm_campaign=Twitter&utm_term", "url": "https://t.co/nx4iBiXzKP"}]}, "id": "2117260304522395653", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 4082, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "China has likely resumed making weapon-grade uranium at Emeishan https://t.co/nx4iBiXzKP", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2117260304522395653"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:19:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117260237476659214"], "id": "2117260237476659214", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 16026, "like_count": 104, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Just realized that gold is sub-$4000/oz.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117260237476659214"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:48:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117252611698995693"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/DemFromCT/stat…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/DemFromCT/status/2117251782397313156", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/i3NvdZga99"}]}, "id": "2117252611698995693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 62336, "like_count": 469, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 43, "retweet_count": 16}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117251782397313156", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I'm not ignoring data. My left brain thinks Dems will probably have a huge night tomorrow. My right brain doesn't believe it. \n\nI'm not talking about the election at all really, I'm saying that humans are built to perceive the world in multiple ways at the same time. https://t.co/i3NvdZga99", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117252611698995693"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:46:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117251889389777137"], "id": "2117251889389777137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 13378, "like_count": 77, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Funny that it could be a big upset if VT elects a Dem governor.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117251889389777137"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:42:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117251067557908649"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2117248826427777223", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/UulNH5WO6T"}]}, "id": "2117251067557908649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 25354, "like_count": 219, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117248826427777223", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Tbh this is probably what people thought about the Midwest states going into 2016 that deep down, there wasn't any chance of MI voting Red, despite all the data showing it was totally possible. https://t.co/UulNH5WO6T", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117251067557908649"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:33:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117248826427777223"], "id": "2117248826427777223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 89, "impression_count": 174139, "like_count": 807, "quote_count": 36, "reply_count": 112, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Deep down, I can't imagine anyone really believes Collins is going to lose, or that Texas will elect a statewide Dem. I mean, either might happen. But I doubt anyone *really* believes it.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2117248826427777223"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:24:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117246352153268735"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 228, "id": "23806613", "start": 216, "username": "SPDJIndices"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/cvv8Xr91TD", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2117246352153268735/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117246349599027201", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/cvv8Xr91TD"}]}, "id": "2117246352153268735", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 14878, "like_count": 95, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "When S&amp;P 500 hit its 4-year bull market anniversary on October 12, only Tech and Communication Services had outperformed the index for that 4-year period; in October, those were the only 2 sectors that were down\n@SPDJIndices https://t.co/cvv8Xr91TD", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2117246352153268735"}, {"author_id": "